Glowcap LLC maintains glowcap under Apache-2.0. Get the
[source](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap) or download a release from
[GitHub Releases](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/releases).

The software version is `0.1.6` alpha. CapTP `1.0` names a wire protocol it
supports.

Under the [alpha release policy](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/docs/maintaining.md#release-status),
APIs, ABIs, and storage formats can change before 1.0, including in patch
releases. Pin a release or commit, read the
[changelog](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md),
and back up stored data before upgrading.

glowcap has not received an independent security audit. Report suspected
vulnerabilities [privately](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/SECURITY.md#reporting-a-vulnerability).

# Where to go next

- **[Start building]($link.page('start'))** walks through a complete call in
  Zig, with guides for other languages.
- **[Choose a transport]($link.page('transports/choosing'))** compares
  identity, encryption, reachability, browser support, and interoperability.
- **[What you can depend on]($link.page('stability'))** shows which behaviors
  are tested and where coverage is missing.
- **[Performance]($link.page('performance'))** reports measured throughput,
  memory use, and latency, with workloads and methods.

# Get help or contribute

Ask a question or report a problem in
[GitHub Issues](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/issues).
Include the release version or commit, your operating system, what you
tried, and what happened. Reports of confusing instructions or failed
interoperability are welcome, with or without a fix.

[Contributing](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)
explains how to run the project and send a fix. Contributions are welcome
with or without AI tools.

# Project records

[What ships](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/docs/shipped.md)
and [known limitations](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/docs/boundaries.md)
list supported features and their constraints. The
[roadmap](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/docs/roadmap.md)
orders the work toward the [milestones to 1.0](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/docs/milestones.md).
The [vision](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/docs/vision.md)
sets the goal, and the [decision records](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/docs/decisions/README.md)
explain the design choices.

# Sponsorship

[Sponsor Glowcap LLC](https://github.com/sponsors/glowcap-org) to support
